WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.012
Window functions are useful when you want group context without collapsing the detail rows.

00:00:06.012 --> 00:00:09.752
Suppose five employees work in the same department.

00:00:09.752 --> 00:00:14.682
A group by query can return one row with the department average salary.

00:00:14.682 --> 00:00:21.306
But sometimes we want all five employee rows and the department average beside every employee.

00:00:21.767 --> 00:00:24.064
That is a window-function problem.

00:00:24.064 --> 00:00:31.579
The same idea works for ranking, previous and next events, running totals, and moving averages.

00:00:31.579 --> 00:00:36.348
The result keeps the original rows and adds analytical information around them.
